総合的に勘案した結果、成長投資のための財務余力を維持しつつ、株主の皆様への利益還元をより充実させるべく、2027年３月期の期末配当予想を１株当たり8円から9円50銭へ1円50銭増額し、年間配当予想を17円（前回予想比1円50銭増、前期実績比2円増）に修正することといたしました。　当社は、中長期的に目指す資本効率の水準として「ROE30％以上」を掲げております。今後も資本コストや株価を意識した経営を実践し、成長投資と株主還元の両立を通じて、持続的な企業価値の向上に努めてまいります。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["PreviousReportingDate", "PreviousReportingDate", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "2026年5月14日", null, "CurrentYearInstant"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 8, "8.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 15.5, "15.50", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 9.5, "9.50", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 17, "17.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "当期", 7.5, "7.50", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 7, "7.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 8, "8.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 15, "15.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["NoteToDividends", "NoteToDividends", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "※ 上記の配当予想は、現時点で入手可能な情報に基づいて判断したものであり、今後の業績や経営環境の変化等により、実際の配当額は予想と異なる可能性があります。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["FiscalYearEnd", "FiscalYearEnd", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "2027-03-31", null, "Curren